          "text": "Huang P'ei-fang 黃培芳 (T. 子實, H. 香石, 粵嶽山人, 1779–1859), a native of Hsiang-shan, a senior licentiate of 1804, and the author of some thirty works, among which are: 嶺海樓詩鈔 Ling-hai lou shih-ch'ao, 12 chüan; Ling-hai lou ching-i (經義), 2 chüan; and 香石詩話 Hsiang-shih shih-hua, 4 chüan (1810).",
